# The champion with the rebuild gate at 15,000: the deep dose of the
# rebuild-under-fire pair ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 1) --
# a razed extractor pool is re-claimed only once the strongest rival's
# army value sits 15,000 below its recent peak. The shallow dose is
# evolve1-g4m2-rb5k; both were invented for Impossible and never priced
# at Very Hard. Motivated by the pinbase48 anatomy (log 2026-09-12):
# every pinned VH loss is income-halved by the 25 percent mark and never
# re-expands. Every other knob is the champion's, so a paired diff
# prices the gate alone.
name evolve1-g4m2-rb15k
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
